<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάδδῐχος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάδος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάδδιχος καλεῖται τὸ ἀγγεῖον εἰς ὃ
					τὰς ἀπομαγδαλίας ἐμβάλλουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>voting-urn</i>, whence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκαδδίχθαι</span></b> , <i>to be rejected on a
			vote</i>, ibid.; also, a <i>measure</i>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμίεκτον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1447.10
			</span></i> (Messene, <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>):— 
				Lacon.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδίκορ</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδεκαδίκορ</span>
			.</div>
